1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,163
Hoo! What sound is that?

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:04,075
Listen!

3
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:06,375
Chirp, chirp!

4
00:00:06,875 --> 00:00:08,884
Who says chirp, chirp?

5
00:00:08,884 --> 00:00:10,250
Can you guess?

6
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:15,029
A cricket!

7
00:00:15,029 --> 00:00:16,583
Crickets sing chirp,

8
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:17,800
chirp at night.

9
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,550
Ribbit, ribbit!

10
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,680
Who says ribbit?

11
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,225
Say it with me!

12
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:25,750
Ribbit!

13
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,402
A little green frog!

14
00:00:31,402 --> 00:00:32,925
Frogs say ribbit.

15
00:00:33,675 --> 00:00:35,275
Hoo, hoo!

16
00:00:35,775 --> 00:00:37,653
And who says hoo-hoo?

17
00:00:37,653 --> 00:00:39,375
It's me, Ollie Owl!

18
00:00:39,725 --> 00:00:41,975
Can you say hoo-hoo?

19
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:47,000
Hoo-hoo! Great listening, friends!

20
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,375
Chirp, ribbit, hoo!

21
00:00:52,025 --> 00:00:53,832
Share with a friend and

22
00:00:53,832 --> 00:00:56,125
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

23
00:00:56,725 --> 00:00:58,362
Watch the full story

24
00:00:58,362 --> 00:00:59,000
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
